":"Java 执行小节。"},{"sourceNodeId":"java-source/java-basic-datatypes#%E5%AE%9E%E4%BE%8B~3","parent":"java-source/java-basic-datatypes","order":10,"tag":"h2","titleOriginal":"实例","titleDisplay":"实例","titlePath":["Java 基本数据类型","实例"],"titleOccurrence":3,"role":"example-caption","anchor":null,"sourceRef":"https://www.runoob.com/java/java-basic-datatypes.html","sourceSha256":"448ce037a7bab45f09ce8d3fad9d35a44f8aa5dd6bc4568986a98bf2f815a67e","questionId":null,"articleSourceOrder":7,"status":"context-only","platformRef":{"id":"java.source.5a7e97a1d6bb5129693b","version":"1.0.0"},"reason":"原例子标题与父子位置。"},{"sourceNodeId":"java-source/java-basic-datatypes#%E5%AE%9E%E4%BE%8B~3/%E5%BC%BA%E5%88%B6%E7%B1%BB%E5%9E%8B%E8%BD%AC%E6%8D%A2~1","parent":"java-source/java-basic-datatypes#%E5%AE%9E%E4%BE%8B~3","order":11,"tag":"h3","titleOriginal":"强制类型转换","titleDisplay":"强制类型转换","titlePath":["Java 基本数据类型","实例","强制类型转换"],"titleOccurrence":1,"role":"teaching","anchor":null,"sourceRef":"https://www.runoob.com/java/java-basic-datatypes.html","sourceSha256":"448ce037a7bab45f09ce8d3fad9d35a44f8aa5dd6bc4568986a98bf2f815a67e","questionId":"java.practice.narrow-to-int","articleSourceOrder":7,"status":"authored","platformRef":{"id":"java.lesson.754b1a109d6294b1631d","version":"1.0.0"},"goal":"根据保留的低 32 位预测 long 转 int。","body":["显式转换 (int) x 会保留 long 的低 32 位，再把这些位解释为有符号 int。4294967297 恰好是 2 的 32 次方再加 1，低位表示 1。","2147483648 的低 32 位最高位为 1，所以结果是 -2147483648。超范围不会因为有显式转换而报错。"],"leaf":true,"exampleId":"java.example.754b1a109d6294b1631d","activityId":"java.practice.narrow-to-int","reason":"Java 执行小节。"},{"sourceNodeId":"java-source/java-basic-datatypes#%E5%AE%9E%E4%BE%8B~4","parent":"java-source/java-basic-datatypes","order":12,"tag":"h2","titleOriginal":"实例","titleDisplay":"实例","titlePath":["Java 基本数据类型","实例"],"titleOccurrence":4,"role":"example-caption","anchor":null,"sourceRef":"https://www.runoob.com/java/java-basic-datatypes.html","sourceSha256":"448ce037a7bab45f09ce8d3fad9d35a44f8aa5dd6bc4568986a98bf2f815a67e","questionId":null,"articleSourceOrder":7,"status":"context-only","platformRef":{"id":"java.source.e5039304bd2b59f235b1","version":"1.0.0"},"reason":"原例子标题与父子位置。"},{"sourceNodeId":"java-source/java-basic-datatypes#%E5%AE%9E%E4%BE%8B~4/%E9%9A%90%E5%90%AB%E5%BC%BA%E5%88%B6%E7%B1%BB%E5%9E%8B%E8%BD%AC%E6%8D%A2~1","parent":"java-source/java-basic-datatypes#%E5%AE%9E%E4%BE%8B~4","order":13,"tag":"h3","titleOriginal":"隐含强制类型转换","titleDisplay":"隐含强制类型转换","titlePath":["Java 基本数据类型","实例","隐含强制类型转换"],"titleOccurrence":1,"role":"teaching","anchor":null,"sourceRef":"https://www.runoob.com/java/java-basic-datatypes.html","sourceSha256":"448ce037a7bab45f09ce8d3fad9d35a44f8aa5dd6bc4568986a98bf2f815a67e","questionId":null,"articleSourceOrder":7,"status":"authored","platformRef":{"id":"java.lesson.b58cd29f25ea5299f6e6","version":"1.0.0"},"goal":"判断复合赋值包含的隐式转换。","body":["Java 的复合赋值会把计算结果按左值类型转换回去，并只求值一次左侧。展开成普通赋值时要把必要转换写明。"],"reason":"依原目录原创改写并保留出处。","leaf":true,"exampleId":"java.example.b58cd29f25ea5299f6e6","activityId":"java.check.b58cd29f25ea5299f6e6"}],"examples":[{"id":"java.example.634f5cb2159e74852749","lessonId":"java.lesson.634f5cb2159e74852749","status":"reading-only","reason":"本节通过完整情景静态推演。","prompt":"本机 Java 中 byte a = 100; byte b = 27; 用 var total = a + b;，total 的类型是什么？","result":"是 int。两个操作数在加法前已提升，127 的结果大小不会把表达式类型缩回 byte。"},{"id":"java.example.d871ca8a8f0655f75de5","lessonId":"java.lesson.d871ca8a8f0655f75de5","status":"reading-only","reason":"本节通过完整情景静态推演。","prompt":"class Box { int count; } 刚创建时 count 是 0。方法中写 int total; 能立即输出 total 吗？","result":"不能。方法局部变量需要满足确定赋值规则，字段的默认值不会延伸到局部。"},{"id":"java.example.44ca5c77922ae3513032","lessonId":"java.lesson.44ca5c77922ae3513032","status":"reading-only","reason":"本节通过完整情景静态推演。","prompt":"int[] one = new int[1]; int[] two = one; two[0] = 4; 此时 one[0] 是多少？","result":"为 4。两处引用指向同一个长度为 1 的数组。"},{"id":"java.example.8b34d03d7da8fe71fe8e","lessonId":"java.lesson.8b34d03d7da8fe71fe8e","status":"reading-only","reason":"本节通过完整情景静态推演。","prompt":"final int[] marks = new int[1]; 可否执行 marks[0] = 3？","result":"在完整 Java 中可以，改的是元素。marks = new int[2]; 会尝试重新绑定 final 变量。"},{"id":"java.example.6f57893a64d0a41e7cec","lessonId":"java.lesson.6f57893a64d0a41e7cec","status":"runnable-required","reason":"可用 Java Rust/WASM 执行并查看真实轨迹。","source":"import java.util.Scanner;\n\npublic class Main {\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        Scanner input = new Scanner(System.in);\n        long a = input.nextInt();\n        int b = input.nextInt();\n        System.out.println(a + b);\n    }\n}","sourceSha256":"265d598bb1b8d95962a7ccef47f0273f7e4889c8c51901f42a44a0b9cf454aa4","cases":[{"name":"输入 1","input":"2147483647 1","stdout":"2147483648\n"},{"name":"输入 2","input":"-2147483648 -1","stdout":"-2147483649\n"},{"name":"输入 3","input":"10 -4","stdout":"6\n"},{"name":"输入 4","input":"0 0","stdout":"0\n"}]},{"id":"java.example.754b1a109d6294b1631d","lessonId":"java.lesson.754b1a109d6294b1631d","status":"runnable-required","reason":"可用 Java Rust/WASM 执行并查看真实轨迹。","source":"import java.util.Scanner;\n\npublic class Main {\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        Scanner input = new Scanner(System.in);\n        long raw = input.nextLong();\n        System.out.println((int) raw);\n    }\n}","sourceSha256":"ab776d86eaf52e81ce5fa0f18e73117894354d77a633d8ffbd9b0fb8fdb7295d","cases":[{"name":"输入 1","input":"4294967297","stdout":"1\n"},{"name":"输入 2","input":"2147483648","stdout":"-2147483648\n"},{"name":"输入 3","input":"-4294967297","stdout":"-1\n"},{"name":"输入 4","input":"9223372036854775807","stdout":"-1\n"}]},{"id":"java.example.b58cd29f25ea5299f6e6","lessonId":"java.lesson.b58cd29f25ea5299f6e6","status":"reading-only","reason":"本节通过完整情景静态推演。","prompt":"本机 Java 中 short n = 2; n += 3; 能否直接改成 n = n + 3;？","result":"后者的右侧为 int，不能直接赋给 short。等价观察要考虑 (short) (n + 3)。"}],"activities":[{"id":"java.check.634f5cb2159e74852749","lessonId":"java.lesson.634f5cb2159e74852749","kind":"optional-self-check","exampleId"